Package: ggdsf
Type: Package
Title: Generalized Gamma Distribution with Shape Function
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Piotr",
    family = "Sulewski",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "piotr.sulewski@upsl.edu.pl"
  )
Description: Implements probability density, cumulative distribution, survival,
    hazard rate, reversed hazard rate, quantile, random generation, similarity
    measure, and information entropy functions (Shannon, Renyi, and Tsallis)
    for the four-parameter Generalized Gamma Distribution with Shape Function
    (GGDSF), along with reproducible scripts for maximum likelihood estimation.
